      </div>
      <div class="bedtech-hero__right">
        <p class="bedtech-hero__showroom-note">
          BedTech is one of our top-selling base brands — we keep adjustable and platform models on the showroom floor so you can test the difference between wireless remotes, massage motors, and wall-hugging motion before you decide.
        </p>
        <div class="bedtech-hero__products">
          <a href="/products/bedtech-bt2000" class="bedtech-hero__product-card">
            <div class="bedtech-hero__product-img">
              <img src="{% if bt2000_prod and bt2000_prod.featured_image %}{{ bt2000_prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 500 }}{% else %}{{ 'bedtech-base.jpg' | asset_url }}{% endif %}" alt="BT2000 Adjustable Bed" loading="lazy">
