      <div class="bedtech-story__img">
        <img src="{% if bt_story_prod and bt_story_prod.featured_image %}{{ bt_story_prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}{% else %}{{ 'bedtech-base.jpg' | asset_url }}{% endif %}" alt="BedTech lifestyle" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="bedtech-story__content">
        <p class="section-label">Why BedTech</p>
        <h2>Adjustable comfort at every price point.</h2>
        <p>BedTech builds adjustable bases and flat platforms for any budget. From simple head/tilt to wall-hugging motion, massage motors, and zero-gravity presets — plus flat options if you don't need the movement.</p>
        <p>Come to our showroom and try the difference between a low-profile platform, a storage-friendly high rise, and a fully adjustable base with massage and zero-gravity. We stock the full lineup.</p>
        <div class="bedtech-story__columns">
          <div class="bedtech-story__col">
            <h4>↔️ Wall-hugging tech</h4>
            <p>Keeps you close to the nightstand as the base articulates — no more reaching for your phone or glasses in the middle of the night.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bedtech-story__col">
            <h4>📡 Wireless remotes</h4>
            <p>Programmable presets and intuitive controls. Store your favorite head/tilt positions and recall them with one button.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bedtech-story__col">
            <h4>💆 Massage motors</h4>
            <p>Built-in massage systems target pressure points and help you relax before sleep. Available on BT3000, BT6500, and BTX5 models.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

